    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover 125 unique flowers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/8bf1d915a95bd4def5d9432dd4fd1a6e.avif?t=1755264150\" width=616 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flowers have traits that affect the world in different ways. Each flower has a different combination of traits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plant &amp; Pick</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/b70ef231ace3ea7cd51d204adcd2921f.poster.avif?t=1755264150\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/b70ef231ace3ea7cd51d204adcd2921f.webm?t=1755264150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a single flower and grow your collection until you have discovered all the types.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random Mutation &amp; Cross Pollination</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/dde6b28ff97c4dd617115b17e2d136c1.avif?t=1755264150\" width=330 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every flower has a chance to mutate into something new. Strategically plant flowers near each other to encourage cross pollination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Objectives</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/793764705796b60467ab317fcacc36b7.avif?t=1755264150\" width=278 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cover the entire area in grass, clear all trash, and discover all the flowers to complete each scenario.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/b45b45e2f1051ba1bf9e89dae02a2007.poster.avif?t=1755264150\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/b45b45e2f1051ba1bf9e89dae02a2007.webm?t=1755264150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 Scenarios</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/33930d61b2559b41d3452cbdacbe352e.avif?t=1755264150\" width=606 height=311 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover 125 unique flowers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/8bf1d915a95bd4def5d9432dd4fd1a6e.avif?t=1755264150\" width=616 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flowers have traits that affect the world in different ways. Each flower has a different combination of traits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plant &amp; Pick</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/b70ef231ace3ea7cd51d204adcd2921f.poster.avif?t=1755264150\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/b70ef231ace3ea7cd51d204adcd2921f.webm?t=1755264150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a single flower and grow your collection until you have discovered all the types.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random Mutation &amp; Cross Pollination</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/dde6b28ff97c4dd617115b17e2d136c1.avif?t=1755264150\" width=330 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every flower has a chance to mutate into something new. Strategically plant flowers near each other to encourage cross pollination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Objectives</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/793764705796b60467ab317fcacc36b7.avif?t=1755264150\" width=278 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cover the entire area in grass, clear all trash, and discover all the flowers to complete each scenario.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/b45b45e2f1051ba1bf9e89dae02a2007.poster.avif?t=1755264150\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/b45b45e2f1051ba1bf9e89dae02a2007.webm?t=1755264150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 Scenarios</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/33930d61b2559b41d3452cbdacbe352e.avif?t=1755264150\" width=606 height=311 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A cozy flower picking and planting game, collect all the flowers! Convert a polluted island, overgrown garden and desert oasis into a blooming flower forest. 125 flowers types with a unique sets of traits. Take advantage of random mutations and cross pollination to discover them all.",
